    "caption": "🔍 Pixel 11 Pro Fold leaks ahead of launch\n\nMarketing renders of the Pixel 11 Pro Fold leaked two weeks before Google's event. The foldable keeps the same 8-inch inner screen and elongated outer display as last year, ignoring trends set by Galaxy Z Fold 8 and the upcoming foldable iPhone.\n\nThe main update is a redesigned camera block with a glowing light feature teased for the Pixel 11 Pro. The new olive-green color stands out, matching leaked Pixel Buds and Pixel Watch in the same shade.\n\n📊@tech",
